{"5075540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In that case...", "steam_appid": 5075540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5076750, 5083500], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THIS IS IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your one chance to leave the 9-to-5 behind and build a new life for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There's just one catch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR LIFE IS THE ENTRANCE FEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You've been invited to a deadly game where opening loot cases is the only way to pay off a growing debt. Every case could contain the drop that earns your financial freedom... or leave you one step closer to a gruesome death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075540/extras/c64869ab2d7cf239f1c18e22af7a19a4.avif?t=1788220548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075540/extras_big/c64869ab2d7cf239f1c18e22af7a19a4.avif?t=1788220548 width=1560 height=568 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO YOUR CELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intimidating at first, but you will quickly get the hang of it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PICK A CASE</strong> to open and <strong>SLAM</strong> that <strong>GREEN BUTTON</strong> to start!<br>Now watch as your drops melt into <strong>BALANCE</strong>. <br>Or watch your <strong>BALANCE</strong> melt into the negatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Repeat.<br><br>Pay off your debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get out before the ceiling of spikes crushes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Simple right?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>:)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Well... about that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LUCK ALONE WON'T SAVE YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Opening cases</strong> is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Managing <strong>your money</strong> is what keeps you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend too much and you'll <strong>never recover</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play <strong>too safely</strong> and you'll run out of time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DO WHATEVER IT TAKES TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Need better luck or bigger better odds?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drink enough energy drinks to make a cardiologist cry. And send your mom into cardiac arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Need more money?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dig yourself in further debt and take a loan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Cases don't make enough?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy up GPUs and build the most profitable mining rig right under your desk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Need motivation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Our home-brew selection of 4 unique soundtracks are <strong>MADE</strong> to keep your blood pumping and your brain <strong>PULSING</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the music intensifies the closer the spikes are to your head.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GO FLAT OUT. OR DIE CRYING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only those daring enough to risk it all will make it out of their cell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong><i>So then<strong>, PLAYER.</strong></i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THINK YOU CAN MAKE IT OUT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In that case... good luck.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><u><i>The Game features a campaign driven</i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive a series of increasingly dangerous death games, each introducing new mechanics, tougher contracts and higher stakes. Every successful escape earns your freedom... until you're offered an even deadlier opportunity.<br><br>and a </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Finished the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the shoes of a rogue employee thrown into a prototype cell to test her own creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with almost nothing and see how far your luck can take you. Compete for a spot on the worldwide leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock new drinks, experiment with different strategies, and build the ultimate run in a fully replayable <strong>roguelike</strong> mode.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THIS IS IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your one chance to leave the 9-to-5 behind and build a new life for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There's just one catch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR LIFE IS THE ENTRANCE FEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You've been invited to a deadly game where opening loot cases is the only way to pay off a growing debt. Every case could contain the drop that earns your financial freedom... or leave you one step closer to a gruesome death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075540/extras/c64869ab2d7cf239f1c18e22af7a19a4.avif?t=1788220548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075540/extras_big/c64869ab2d7cf239f1c18e22af7a19a4.avif?t=1788220548 width=1560 height=568 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO YOUR CELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intimidating at first, but you will quickly get the hang of it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PICK A CASE</strong> to open and <strong>SLAM</strong> that <strong>GREEN BUTTON</strong> to start!<br>Now watch as your drops melt into <strong>BALANCE</strong>. <br>Or watch your <strong>BALANCE</strong> melt into the negatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Repeat.<br><br>Pay off your debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align